# round 114 (w131): the objective ladder and the GECKO pool stores, solved OFFLINE with NO proteome (ess_gecko_store.py), read as the module columns on the corrected YPD medium. Rungs: plainfba (growth only, no parsimony, HiGHS dual simplex vertex), pfbalambda3 and pfbalambda4 (parsimony inside the objective, lambda 1e-3 and 1e-4), pool125 / pool250 (GECKO: enzyme usages as program variables under the 0.125 or 0.25 g/gDW pool, parsimony on flux), pool125s1 (kcat at one sigma up), pool125minenz (parsimony on enzyme mass). Read fixed here: paired by seed against w129_ypdgprnuc (plain pFBA, same seeds), six seeds each.
